    "prompt": "A 40 year old female patient complains of excessive bleeding and drowsiness. Patient gives a history of road traffic accident 5 hours ago and had a lacerated wound on lower back region. General physical examination reveals- Blood pressure-80/60mmHg. Juglar venous pressure- low. Pulsus paradoxus- present. Cardiac output- Increased. The patient is in which type of shock?",
