      "oep-ke-keph-pharmacy-051-option-0": "Taking it on an empty stomach increases gastrointestinal upset.",
      "oep-ke-keph-pharmacy-051-option-2": "Modified-release tablets must not be crushed, as this defeats the controlled release.",
