    "explanation": "Oxcarbamazepine is contraindicated in all of these conditions. It should not be used in patients with known hypersensitivity to carbamazepine or oxcarbamazepine, those with a history of bone marrow depression, patients with hepatic porphyrias, and in cases of severe renal impairment. These contraindications are due to the increased risk of serious adverse reactions or reduced drug clearance in these patient groups.",
