    "prompt": "A 28-year-old female opts for painless labor. On administration of the epidural anesthetic, there is a sudden drop in the blood pressure. The reason for this was found to be accidental intravenous injection of the anesthetic drug. Which of the following drugs is the most likely responsible for the present condition?",
